OL,3,AFlights delayed at major US airports
OL,4,Aafter cable cut by construction workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlights are delayed at major US
OL,7,Fairports after construction workers cut
OL,8,Fa cable needed for air traffic control,
OL,9,Fa top aviation official says
OL,11,FFederal Aviation Administration
OL,12,Fofficial Bryan Bedford says the issue
OL,13,Fis related to a system that guides
OL,14,Fplanes during take-off and landing
OL,16,FSecretary of Transportation Sean Duffy
OL,17,Fsays the construction crew was working
OL,18,Ffor national rain operator Amtrak when
OL,19,Fthe cable was cut in New Jersey
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
