OL,3,AFlights delayed at major US airports
OL,4,Aafter cable cut by construction workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FGround stops have been ordered at
OL,7,Fairports in New Jersey, while Duffy
OL,8,Fsays flights are resuming at New York's
OL,9,FLaGuardia and Philadelphia - though the
OL,10,Fairports are still experiencing heavy
OL,11,Fdelays
OL,13,FThe major east coast disruption comes
OL,14,Fahead of the United Nations General
OL,15,FAssembly in New York City on Tuesday
